:"Every clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph whose size is in a range, once each, lazily,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order (by vertex index). The order is by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then depth first, each clique followed by its extensions by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later vertices in ascending index. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating again gives the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d) bitset words per clique for degeneracy d."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllCliques"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllCliques"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/AllCliques/lazy":{"kind":"symbol","title":"lazy","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques\/lazy","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/allcliques\/lazy","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lazy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LazySequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[],"role":"symbol"}}}